⚙️ GitHub Actions – Real-World DevOps Scenarios
 1. A workflow runs on every commit, but you want it only on pull requests. How do you fix it?
 2. A GitHub Actions workflow passes locally but fails in the pipeline. How do you debug?
 3. Secrets are printed in GitHub Actions logs. What immediate actions do you take?
 4. A workflow suddenly stopped triggering. How do you investigate?
 5. How do you design multi-environment deployments using GitHub Actions?
 6. A job is stuck waiting for a runner. How do you fix and scale runners?
 7. How do you securely manage secrets in GitHub Actions?
 8. A deployment succeeded, but production is not updated. How do you debug?
 9. How do you implement approval-based deployments in GitHub Actions?
 10. Workflow execution time increased significantly. How do you optimize it?
 11. How do you integrate GitHub Actions with Kubernetes?
 12. A third-party GitHub Action is compromised. How do you respond?
 13. How do you prevent unauthorized workflow execution?
 14. How do you version and reuse workflows across repositories?
 15. How do you audit who triggered what workflow and when?

